# SDL 2.32 for the Xbox 360, from SDL2x360 with the OXDK360 patches applied.
#
# SDL is compiled into the title rather than linked as a library, which is how
# every other OXDK360 port here does it: there is no install step and no
# libSDL2.a, so the sources are simply part of the build.
#
# Set SDL2X360_DIR to the directory holding SDL2x360/ and x360shaders/.
# gl_shaders360.cpp is not the GL shim here. SDL_render_d3d.c includes it for
# the base vertex and pixel shaders, which have to be real Xenos microcode
# because this console has no fixed function pipeline.

